<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="de">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow">
    <title>silas-krummen.de</title>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="/favicon.png">
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Space+Grotesk:wght@500;600;700&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/app.css">
    <style>
        .landing {
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
        }
        .landing .hero {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 56px;
            width: 100%;
        }
        .landing__text {
            flex: 1 1 auto;
        }
        .landing .hero__title {
            max-width: 16ch;
        }
        .landing .hero__portrait {
            width: 32%;
            max-width: 340px;
        }
        @media (max-width: 720px) {
            .landing .hero {
                flex-direction: column-reverse;
                align-items: flex-start;
                gap: 32px;
                padding-top: 40px;
            }
            .landing .hero__portrait {
                width: 60%;
                max-width: 260px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
<main class="landing">
    <section class="hero">
        <div class="landing__text">
            <p class="hero__eyebrow">$ ls ~</p>
            <h1 class="hero__title">Hi, ich bin Silas.</h1>
            <p class="hero__subtitle">
                Hier liegen ein paar Dinge, die ich gebaut habe. Für die meisten brauchst du einen Zugang.
                Falls dir einer fehlt, schreib mir an
                <a href="mailto:silas.krummen@web.de">silas.krummen@web.de</a>.
            </p>
            <div class="hero__actions">
                <a href="{{ path('homepage') }}" class="btn btn--primary">Portfolio</a>
                <a href="{{ path('lan_display') }}" class="btn btn--ghost">LAN-Night</a>
                <a href="{{ path('civ_open', {target: 'display'}) }}" class="btn btn--ghost">CIV-Abend</a>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="hero__portrait">
            <img src="/pictures/landing.jpg" alt="Selfie von Silas und einem Freund abends auf einem Stadtfest">
        </div>
    </section>
</main>
</body>
</html>
